="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKIMOTO AKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANAKA YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAGISHI SHIGEKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KURATOMI, YASUNORI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGIWARA, AKIFUMI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKIMOTO, AKIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, YUKIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAGISHI, SHIGEKAZU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KURATOMI YASUNORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OGIWARA AKIFUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKIMOTO AKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANAKA YUKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAGISHI SHIGEKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KURATOMI, YASUNORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGIWARA, AKIFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKIMOTO, AKIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANAKA, YUKIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAGISHI, SHIGEKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An optical medium of a mixture of liquid crystal and a polymer precursor is disposed between a pair of glass substrates (1202) and exposed to light, e.g., in the form of interference fringes having a wavelength of about 515 nm and produced using a laser beam of an Ar laser for about 5 minutes, while heated at, e.g., 50 DEG  to 70  DEG C.  On starting exposure, the polymer precursor starts to be cured (first stage), and periodically arranged polymer columns (1203) are formed, as shown in Figure 10(a). When the exposure is further continued, liquid crystal molecules gathering in dark regions are aligned macroscopically uniformly perpendicularly to the walls of the cured polymer columns (1203), as shown in Figure 10(b) (second stage). A diffraction optical device thus fabricated exhibits a high polarized-light selectivity and a high diffraction efficiency. A polarized light illuminator and an image display comprising such a diffraction optical device can realize display of a bright and high-contrast image.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un support optique constitué d'un mélange de cristaux liquides et d'un précurseur polymère est disposé entre une paire de substrats en verre (1202) et exposé à de la lumière, par exemple, sous la forme de franges d'interférence ayant une longueur d'onde d'environ 515 nm et produites par un faisceau laser d'un laser Ar pendant environ 5 minutes, tout en étant chauffé, par exemple, entre 50 DEG  et 70  DEG C. Au début de l'exposition, le précurseur polymère commence à être durci (première étape) et des colonnes (1203) en polymère agencées périodiquement sont formées telles que l'illustre la figure 10(a). Lorsque l'on poursuit l'exposition, des molécules de cristaux liquides se regroupant dans les régions sombres sont alignées de façon macroscopique uniforme et perpendiculaire aux parois des colonnes (1203) en polymère durci, tel que l'illustre la figure 10(b) (seconde étape). Un dispositif optique de diffraction ainsi fabriqué présente une haute sélectivité de la lumière polarisée et une haute efficacité de diffraction. Un photo-illuminateur polarisé et un affichage d'image comprenant ce dispositif optique de diffraction permettent d'obtenir l'affichage d'une image lumineuse et à fort contraste.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>